bb_tag\" >Routes, shortcuts, and risk</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Choose between safer paths and faster, riskier shortcuts<br></li><li>Big rewards for consistency, not luck</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solo or online with friends</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Climb solo and fight your way toward the summit<br></li><li>Play online in peer-to-peer multiplayer and race or climb together</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A climb with personality</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Cute presentation, ruthless platforming<br></li><li>Secrets and easter eggs for explorers and spectators<br></li><li>Small Finnish-inspired details and references hidden throughout the climb</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Time Attack &amp; mastery</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Replay for better routes, cleaner execution, and faster times<br></li><li>Push yourself higher with skill, confidence, and nerve</li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985280/extras/624a48a9f500a2f9ddc2257801e20fe8.webp?t=1775048543\" width=617 height=57 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Can you reach the top?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chick with human legs. A massive climb. A Golden Leg Press at the top. <strong>Chick That Never Skipped a Leg Day</strong> is a brutal-but-fair 3D challenge platformer where every mistake can cost you height. Learn the routes, master the movement, keep your composure, and turn brutal sections into muscle memory.</p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985280/extras/279aea3619c6eb7eb55c06ae83d2d1bb.poster.avif?t=1775048543\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985280/extras/279aea3619c6eb7eb55c06ae83d2d1bb.webm?t=1775048543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.st